      "message": "Let\u0027s use Truth (not Assert.assertThat):\n\n`import static com.google.common.truth.Truth.assertThat;`\n\n`assertThat(state).isInstanceOf(BassClientStateMachine.Disconnected.class);`\n\nHere and others",
